WEBVTT

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:43.640
Wh-What happened?!

00:00:56.660 --> 00:00:57.740
ONIMAI: I'm Now Your Sister

00:00:58.240 --> 00:00:59.370
ONIMAI: I'm Now Your Sister

00:01:01.540 --> 00:01:04.660
Mahiro Oyama

00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:10.880
Mihari Oyama

00:02:05.680 --> 00:02:13.980
ONIMAI: I'm Now Your Sister

00:02:14.610 --> 00:02:16.520
The water heater's broken?

00:02:16.890 --> 00:02:19.080
Yeah, the water's cold.

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:22.370
#02 Mahiro's Time of the Month

00:02:19.080 --> 00:02:21.110
You're a genius scientist, aren't you?

00:02:21.110 --> 00:02:22.450
Can't you fix it?

00:02:22.450 --> 00:02:24.370
