00:02:24.740 --> 00:02:26.820
Welp, guess we're not
taking baths today, then!

00:02:26.820 --> 00:02:28.190
Not a chance!

00:02:29.440 --> 00:02:32.790
Hang on! Isn't there a public bath near us?

00:02:32.790 --> 00:02:36.220
Oh yeah, that one across
from the liquor store?

00:02:36.680 --> 00:02:39.840
Well, go get ready.
I'm gonna go get dressed.

00:02:39.840 --> 00:02:41.380
Aww...

00:02:45.740 --> 00:02:47.850
A public bath, huh?

00:02:48.630 --> 00:02:49.660
Wait a sec!

00:02:49.660 --> 00:02:51.010
Don't you think that's a bad idea?!

00:02:55.930 --> 00:02:59.150
W-Welp, guess we're here...

00:02:59.150 --> 00:03:02.050
Come on, Onii-chan. What's keeping you?

00:03:02.050 --> 00:03:03.810
C-Coming...

00:03:17.090 --> 00:03:18.380
Women

00:03:17.090 --> 00:03:19.430
Uh...

00:03:18.420 --> 00:03:20.540
Men

00:03:20.460 --> 00:03:22.010
Well, see you later.

00:03:22.010 --> 00:03:23.290
Wait, stop!

00:03:23.290 --> 00:03:24.500
Where are you going?!

00:03:24.510 --> 00:03:30.430
Men

00:03:24.820 --> 00:03:26.210
C-Come on, Mihari!

00:03:26.210 --> 00:03:27.460
I can't just waltz into the women's baths!

00:03:27.460 --> 00:03:30.430
Who cares? You're a girl now, anyway.

00:03:30.750 --> 00:03:32.720
Hello, welcome!

00:03:32.720 --> 00:03:34.600
Entry for two, please.

00:03:34.900 --> 00:03:35.920
And your change.

00:03:37.270 --> 00:03:40.940
Women

00:03:39.340 --> 00:03:40.950
B-But wait!

00:03:41.430 --> 00:03:42.750
Well, whatever.

00:03:42.750 --> 00:03:45.130
If Mihari's fine with it...

00:03:45.840 --> 00:03:47.950
If she says it's okay...

00:03:48.290 --> 00:03:50.700
Women

00:03:56.360 --> 00:03:58.920
Yup, looks about right.

00:03:58.920 --> 00:04:00.610
Sorry to disappoint.

00:04:10.990 --> 00:04:14.270
So, I don't care if people see me.

00:04:14.710 --> 00:04:16.490
But what about you?

00:04:16.490 --> 00:04:18.910
Huh? Why do you ask—?

00:04:19.760 --> 00:04:22.330
Q-Q-Quit staring at me!

00:04:22.330 --> 00:04:23.110
Relax.

00:04:23.110 --> 00:04:25.950
I couldn't care less about
seeing my sister naked.

00:04:28.280 --> 00:04:31.200
Kerorin

00:04:33.400 --> 00:04:35.790
Wow, this place is awesome!

00:04:36.120 --> 00:04:38.300
It's bigger than I thought it was gonna be!

00:04:42.480 --> 00:04:45.020
Hey, look! They have spa jets!

00:04:46.090 --> 00:04:47.200
Come back here!

00:04:47.200 --> 00:04:48.660
We have to shower first!

00:04:49.260 --> 00:04:50.900
Yes, ma'am...

00:04:52.810 --> 00:04:54.550
Umph.

00:05:03.410 --> 00:05:04.640
All done.

00:05:05.090 --> 00:05:06.440
Stop right there!

00:05:06.440 --> 00:05:08.430
What? I showered, didn't I?

00:05:08.430 --> 00:05:11.120
Your hair's longer now!
You've gotta be more thorough!

00:05:11.420 --> 00:05:13.650
Here, now's as good a time as any.

00:05:13.650 --> 00:05:15.340
Let me show you how it's done.

00:05:15.340 --> 00:05:16.630
Ugh...

00:05:17.210 --> 00:05:21.410
First, brush out your hair
to remove any build-up.

00:05:21.410 --> 00:05:23.810
You should really do this before it's wet,

00:05:23.810 --> 00:05:25.260
but just remember for next time, okay?

00:05:25.260 --> 00:05:26.320
Ow, ow, ouch!

00:05:27.150 --> 00:05:31.930
Next, wet your hair thoroughly
with warm water.

00:05:32.290 --> 00:05:35.240
Now, in your palm, work the
shampoo into a lather...

00:05:36.400 --> 00:05:38.470
Then gently massage the
product into your scalp.

00:05:44.070 --> 00:05:46.660
Try not to scrub too hard, though.

00:05:50.500 --> 00:05:52.500
After that, rinse thoroughly.

00:05:53.500 --> 00:05:56.760
With long hair like this,
it should take around five minutes.

00:05:56.760 --> 00:05:59.370
Five minutes? Are you serious?!

00:06:09.400 --> 00:06:11.510
It's finally over.

00:06:12.560 --> 00:06:13.460
Huh?

00:06:12.560 --> 00:06:14.500
And for the final touch...

00:06:15.560 --> 00:06:18.640
A leave-in treatment for the ends!

00:06:18.640 --> 00:06:21.250
What? You're kidding, right?

00:06:23.870 --> 00:06:26.650
Somebody help!

00:06:31.760 --> 00:06:34.120
Now we can finally relax in the tub.

00:06:34.500 --> 00:06:38.150
It's bad manners to soak your
hair in the water, remember?

00:06:40.580 --> 00:06:44.670
You'll be chilly after all the hair care,
but a good, long soak will warm you back—

00:06:45.010 --> 00:06:46.200
Enough!

00:06:46.200 --> 00:06:47.090
What?!

00:06:47.580 --> 00:06:49.390
But we just got in!

00:06:49.390 --> 00:06:51.610
I'll wait for you in the lobby!

00:06:54.570 --> 00:06:56.040
Honestly...

00:07:01.370 --> 00:07:04.210
No wonder girls take ages in the bath.

00:07:01.810 --> 00:07:12.240
Women

00:07:09.860 --> 00:07:12.230
Now, that hits the spot!

00:07:19.790 --> 00:07:23.730
Still, it's been ages since we
bathed together like that, huh?

00:07:23.730 --> 00:07:25.330
Come on, hold still!

00:07:26.010 --> 00:07:27.110
Get back here!

00:07:30.260 --> 00:07:32.260
You'll catch a cold if
you don't dry your hair!

00:07:35.220 --> 00:07:36.760
I'm gonna start rinsing now.

00:07:36.760 --> 00:07:38.420
Keep your eyes shut, okay?

00:07:38.420 --> 00:07:38.920
Okay!

00:07:41.160 --> 00:07:44.350
I used to help her bathe all
the time when we were kids.

00:07:45.060 --> 00:07:46.310
Okay, all done!

00:07:48.610 --> 00:07:50.300
Thanks, Onii-chan!

00:07:56.280 --> 00:07:58.330
Now, it looks like...

00:08:02.300 --> 00:08:04.330
she's the one helping me.

00:08:05.120 --> 00:08:07.440
Mihari's grown up so much since then, too.

00:08:07.440 --> 00:08:08.600
I mean...

00:08:07.440 --> 00:08:09.450
Thanks, Onii-chan!

00:08:08.600 --> 00:08:10.820
If this keeps up, it's kinda like...

00:08:10.820 --> 00:08:12.830
She won't be my "little" sister anymore...

00:08:12.840 --> 00:08:16.510
Women

00:08:13.280 --> 00:08:14.360
Onii-cha—

00:08:15.860 --> 00:08:17.430
Mahiro-chan?

00:08:18.010 --> 00:08:19.650
Oh, there you are!

00:08:19.650 --> 00:08:20.840
Sorry for the wait!

00:08:20.840 --> 00:08:22.430
"Mahiro-chan"?

00:08:23.670 --> 00:08:26.100
Well, we're out in public, you know?

00:08:26.100 --> 00:08:28.390
I can't call you "Onii-chan" here, can I?

00:08:30.020 --> 00:08:32.070
I guess you're right.

00:08:36.470 --> 00:08:37.950
Well, let's head home!

00:08:42.970 --> 00:08:44.400
Onee-chan!

00:08:46.430 --> 00:08:49.390
O-O-Onee-chan...

00:08:49.390 --> 00:08:50.400
Whoa, there!

00:08:50.400 --> 00:08:52.100
I was just playing along!

00:08:52.610 --> 00:08:54.760
Onee-chan...

00:08:55.120 --> 00:08:57.270
That settles it.
Let's come here again, okay?

00:08:57.270 --> 00:08:58.390
Q-Quit it!

00:08:58.390 --> 00:09:00.640
Get off of me!

00:09:00.640 --> 00:09:02.530
Pat, pat, pat.

00:09:01.650 --> 00:09:03.530
Stop stroking my hair!

00:09:04.630 --> 00:09:06.120
It's still damp...

00:09:09.440 --> 00:09:14.110
I think it's high time your big sis taught
you how to dry your hair properly.

00:09:14.360 --> 00:09:17.480
This is torture!

00:09:19.990 --> 00:09:22.040
ONIMAI

00:09:20.400 --> 00:09:21.710
Onimai.

00:09:27.050 --> 00:09:28.410
I'm sleepy.

00:09:30.680 --> 00:09:33.650
Onii-chan! Breakfast is ready!

00:09:33.650 --> 00:09:35.100
Coming!

00:09:39.550 --> 00:09:41.420
Wait, Onii-chan!

00:09:41.420 --> 00:09:43.480
Your hair's soaking wet!

00:09:43.480 --> 00:09:44.540
Ugh.

00:09:45.320 --> 00:09:48.890
