every time I wash my face.

00:09:48.890 --> 00:09:52.410
Goodness. That's why you should wear this.

00:09:54.490 --> 00:09:57.150
Hm, this thing's kinda neat.

00:09:57.150 --> 00:09:58.240
Right?

00:09:58.590 --> 00:10:01.520
Wow, girls have so many cool
items in their inventory.

00:10:01.520 --> 00:10:03.680
Like this, and bras, and stuff.

00:10:03.680 --> 00:10:06.420
Stop talking like we're in a video game.

00:10:06.690 --> 00:10:10.000
Try to take hair care more
seriously from now on, okay?

00:10:10.000 --> 00:10:12.770
Hair is a crucial part of our
self-expression, you know?

00:10:12.770 --> 00:10:14.090
Yeah, yeah.

00:10:20.290 --> 00:10:21.570
This is pretty good.

00:10:24.840 --> 00:10:28.030
Man, I'm stuffed!

00:10:29.030 --> 00:10:32.440
I wonder when I last ate a
proper breakfast like this.

00:10:37.190 --> 00:10:39.560
Oh, it's just a mirror.

00:10:39.560 --> 00:10:41.940
I guess Mihari must have put it here.

00:10:46.000 --> 00:10:47.880
Hair care, huh?

00:10:51.930 --> 00:10:53.200
There.

00:10:53.610 --> 00:10:55.630
All done!

00:10:55.630 --> 00:10:58.510
Crap! What the hell am I doing?!

00:11:00.640 --> 00:11:02.500
My goodness, how cute!

00:11:06.130 --> 00:11:09.920
It's just, you know, it's been
getting hot out recently.

00:11:09.920 --> 00:11:13.900
So I thought I'd try putting my
hair up like you saw, and well...

00:11:14.220 --> 00:11:18.800
I started trying a bunch of
styles and got kind of into it.

00:11:18.800 --> 00:11:21.620
You have some of the most
random talents, Onii-chan.

00:11:21.620 --> 00:11:24.560
Comes from playing video games.
My hand-eye coordination is—

00:11:24.560 --> 00:11:26.570
Wait! I have an idea.

00:11:26.570 --> 00:11:28.300
Let's document our findings!

00:11:28.300 --> 00:11:28.940
Huh?!

00:11:29.650 --> 00:11:31.370
Starting with buns.

00:11:31.450 --> 00:11:32.860
So cute!

00:11:32.860 --> 00:11:34.210
Y-You think so?

00:11:35.730 --> 00:11:38.040
Now for a sporty ponytail!

00:11:38.040 --> 00:11:39.000
You look adorable!

00:11:39.000 --> 00:11:40.280
Okay, next!

00:11:42.390 --> 00:11:45.000
Twintails! A classic!

00:11:45.000 --> 00:11:46.720
Stunning!

00:11:49.080 --> 00:11:50.870
Why not add some cat ears, too?

00:11:51.740 --> 00:11:54.190
Come on, Onii-chan! Strike a pose!

00:11:54.190 --> 00:11:55.740
Huh? What pose?

00:11:55.990 --> 00:11:56.920
Don't think, just do!

00:11:56.250 --> 00:11:58.130
Uh— But I don't—

00:11:56.920 --> 00:11:58.890
You got this, Mahiro-chan!

00:11:58.890 --> 00:11:59.710
You're beautiful!

00:11:59.710 --> 00:12:00.390
Captivating!

00:12:00.390 --> 00:12:01.650
Absolutely adorable!

00:12:01.940 --> 00:12:03.100
Now pose like a cat!

00:12:03.100 --> 00:12:04.830
L-Like a cat?!

00:12:05.160 --> 00:12:08.450
R-Right meow?

00:12:10.160 --> 00:12:10.840
Hold it!

00:12:11.820 --> 00:12:13.990
What am I, your puppet?!

00:12:13.150 --> 00:12:13.990
Oh dear.

00:12:14.650 --> 00:12:16.880
Wh-What have I become?

00:12:17.420 --> 00:12:21.700
When did my feminine side become
so second nature to me?

00:12:21.700 --> 00:12:23.380
Excellent.

00:12:23.380 --> 00:12:27.350
I've noticed there's less friction
with your new wardrobe now, too.

00:12:27.350 --> 00:12:29.430
Dressing up feels good, doesn't it?

00:12:29.430 --> 00:12:31.230
Th-That's not...

00:12:31.820 --> 00:12:33.750
Besides, look who's talking!

00:12:33.750 --> 00:12:37.180
How can you say that when you basically
wear the same outfit every day?!

00:12:37.180 --> 00:12:39.290
Th-That's different.

00:12:39.290 --> 00:12:41.810
This is like my uniform.

00:12:42.120 --> 00:12:43.920
My trademark outfit, if you will.

00:12:43.920 --> 00:12:45.880
Why don't you try dressing up for a change?!

00:12:45.880 --> 00:12:46.740
What?!

00:12:47.100 --> 00:12:50.750
H-How dare you?!
This is rich coming from you!

00:12:50.750 --> 00:12:52.040
Just you watch!

00:13:17.740 --> 00:13:19.630
W-Well?

00:13:20.030 --> 00:13:20.930
Hmm?

00:13:21.820 --> 00:13:24.360
A-Are you happy now?

00:13:24.730 --> 00:13:25.510
Wha?

00:13:26.590 --> 00:13:28.750
Oh... sure.

00:13:31.840 --> 00:13:32.950
Ouch!

00:13:33.670 --> 00:13:35.300
What was that fo—?!

00:13:35.890 --> 00:13:39.000
Hey! I didn't do anything!

00:13:41.210 --> 00:13:43.010
ONIMAI

00:13:41.300 --> 00:13:42.450
Onimai.

00:13:43.950 --> 00:13:45.280
Onimeow.

00:13:45.220 --> 00:13:45.610
ONIMAI

00:13:54.630 --> 00:13:56.160
You even sit differently.

00:14:00.920 --> 00:14:02.300
My goodness.

00:14:02.300 --> 00:14:05.310
You've really gotten into
the swing of things, huh?

00:14:06.990 --> 00:14:11.970
It's just, that position feels more
natural in this body, somehow.

00:14:12.620 --> 00:14:14.800
Not good! This is not good!

00:14:18.550 --> 00:14:20.760
I'm gonna reclaim my masculinity!

00:14:21.250 --> 00:14:23.150
...is what I'd like to say, but...

00:14:23.680 --> 00:14:25.460
What does it mean to be...

00:14:25.460 --> 00:14:26.230
masculine?

00:14:26.230 --> 00:14:27.160
Oh, dear.

00:14:28.070 --> 00:14:31.000
Well, let's see. First things first...

00:14:31.000 --> 00:14:32.060
Someone who's strong!

00:14:32.060 --> 00:14:33.680
Strong!

00:14:33.680 --> 00:14:35.340
Reliable!

00:14:35.340 --> 00:14:36.740
Reliable!

00:14:36.740 --> 00:14:38.380
Able to whisk someone off their feet!

00:14:40.190 --> 00:14:41.190
Ouch.

00:14:43.120 --> 00:14:44.980
H-How about a piggyback?

00:14:45.600 --> 00:14:47.190
Here I go!

00:14:52.750 --> 00:14:55.120
Okay, let's sumo-wrestle!

00:14:56.940 --> 00:14:58.000
Bring it!

00:15:01.810 --> 00:15:03.650
Fine, we settle this with video games!

00:15:03.650 --> 00:15:05.850
What does that have to do with masculinity?

00:15:10.170 --> 00:15:13.220
I think you should be worrying
less about masculinity

00:15:13.220 --> 00:15:15.560
and more about setting a
routine for yourself.

00:15:15.560 --> 00:15:16.530
Fine.

00:15:17.420 --> 00:15:19.750
Getting up at a set time every day,

00:15:19.750 --> 00:15:21.540
moderating video game time,

00:15:21.540 --> 00:15:23.360
building up an exercise regimen...

00:15:23.360 --> 00:15:24.600
Exercise...

00:15:26.930 --> 00:15:28.050
That's it!

00:15:28.050 --> 00:15:29.130
Strength training!

00:15:29.130 --> 00:15:30.580
Whoops-a-daisy.

00:15:41.430 --> 00:15:42.850
I tried.

00:15:42.850 --> 00:15:44.480
Wait, what?!

00:15:44.480 --> 00:15:46.390
Were you trying to do a sit-up?!

00:15:47.650 --> 00:15:50.970
If you wanna exercise, you'll need
to try a little harder than that.

00:15:54.480 --> 00:15:57.860
Ow, ow, ow. I think I sprained something.

00:15:57.860 --> 00:15:59.000
You can't be serious.

00:15:59.630 --> 00:16:01.710
No, really...

00:16:02.380 --> 00:16:06.380
I'm starting to feel kinda funny, too.

00:16:08.560 --> 00:16:10.580
What? What's wrong?

00:16:11.460 --> 00:16:12.760
Onii-chan?!

00:16:21.080 --> 00:16:23.080
I feel a lot better now, actually.

00:16:26.800 --> 00:16:28.850
Thank goodness!

00:16:30.820 --> 00:16:33.390
H-Hey! Don't cry!

00:16:33.390 --> 00:16:35.170
It's not that big a deal.

00:16:35.460 --> 00:16:37.430
I-I can't help it!

00:16:37.430 --> 00:16:41.070
I worried what I'd do
without you, you know?!

00:16:46.120 --> 00:16:48.510
What even was that, anyway?

00:16:48.510 --> 00:16:51.290
It doesn't feel like I
have a cold or anything.

00:16:52.280 --> 00:16:53.300
Don't tell me!

00:16:53.810 --> 00:16:56.860
You don't think it's a side effect
of that medicine you gave me?!

00:16:59.440 --> 00:17:03.560
No, I swear I took all the
necessary precautions.

00:17:03.560 --> 00:17:04.590
And besides,

00:17:04.590 --> 00:17:10.060
it'd be strange for side effects to
suddenly occur almost a month in.

00:17:11.580 --> 00:17:12.920
A month?

00:17:22.330 --> 00:17:23.710
Um...

00:17:24.150 --> 00:17:26.550
Do you happen to have any other symptoms?

00:17:26.550 --> 00:17:28.330
Like what?

00:17:28.620 --> 00:17:29.780
Feeling sleepy?

00:17:29.780 --> 00:17:30.940
I'd say so.

00:17:30.940 --> 00:17:32.240
Sluggish?

00:17:32.240 --> 00:17:33.110
Yup.

00:17:33.520 --> 00:17:36.930
Kinda low-energy?
A bit down in the dumps?

00:17:37.450 --> 00:17:40.450
Excuse you! Don't bad-mouth
the home security officer!

00:17:40.450 --> 00:17:43.180
I'm not! Just listen, okay?

00:17:45.500 --> 00:17:47.450
Do your breasts feel swollen at all?

00:17:48.410 --> 00:17:49.550
My breasts?

00:17:51.920 --> 00:17:55.990
Now that you mention it,
they do feel a little tender.

00:17:55.990 --> 00:17:57.290
What about your tummy?

00:17:57.290 --> 00:18:00.160
Does it feel like you have an upset stomach?

00:18:00.160 --> 00:18:02.480
Yeah, you're right! It does!

00:18:02.870 --> 00:18:05.750
Y-You know, Onii-chan...

00:18:05.750 --> 00:18:08.620
I don't wanna scare you or anything, but...

00:18:08.620 --> 00:18:10.200
I think you might be on your—

00:18:10.200 --> 00:18:12.790
Ugh, it's starting to hurt again.

00:18:17.630 --> 00:18:20.130
Sorry, I gotta go to the bathroom.

00:18:26.290 --> 00:18:27.900
W-Wait!

00:18:29.140 --> 00:18:30.780
What is it?

00:18:31.470 --> 00:18:35.900
Um... Well... Err...

00:18:35.900 --> 00:18:38.850
J-Just try not to freak out, okay?

00:18:47.010 --> 00:18:50.180
What's she so worked up about, anyway?

00:18:52.080 --> 00:18:55.710
I've been to the bathroom
plenty of times.

00:19:23.530 --> 00:19:25.980
That's it. This is the end.

00:19:25.980 --> 00:19:28.110
Onii-chan, I can explain...

00:19:28.110 --> 00:19:30.620
I had my whole life ahead of me.

00:19:30.620 --> 00:19:31.780
Listen to me.

00:19:32.060 --> 00:19:36.490
If I had only known, I would've
finished that game sooner.

00:19:37.240 --> 00:19:41.000
Mihari, it's up to you now.

00:19:47.100 --> 00:19:48.300
Onii-chan.

00:19:51.500 --> 00:19:54.130
Here, this'll warm up your tummy.

00:19:57.730 --> 00:20:00.910
It should help with the pain.

00:20:03.560 --> 00:20:06.500
It's recommended to do some
light stretching, too.

00:20:08.170 --> 00:20:10.470
We can do some together once
the pain settles down a bit.

00:20:19.320 --> 00:20:23.890
Red Beans
Over Rice

00:20:19.490 --> 00:20:21.640
I also brought a ready meal, if you'd like.

00:20:21.640 --> 00:20:22.850
No, thank you!

00:20:36.200 --> 00:20:37.930
Did you put it on properly?

00:20:38.620 --> 00:20:39.990
I think so.

00:20:47.850 --> 00:20:51.330
It feels kinda... awkward.

00:20:52.630 --> 00:20:55.680
Do you guys really wear these things?

00:21:00.310 --> 00:21:02.900
They're so uncomfortable.

00:21:04.880 --> 00:21:06.760
You'll get used to it.

00:21:06.760 --> 00:21:08.600
I don't know...

00:21:08.600 --> 00:21:11.180
You complain, but don't guys have—

00:21:12.370 --> 00:21:13.540
Have what?

00:21:13.810 --> 00:21:16.930
Don't guys have a foreign
object to contend with too?

00:21:16.930 --> 00:21:18.240
Below the waist, I mean.

00:21:18.770 --> 00:21:20.250
Don't call it that!

00:21:20.590 --> 00:21:22.930
How do you normally keep it under control?

00:21:22.930 --> 00:21:23.970
What?!

00:21:23.970 --> 00:21:25.590
How can you ask such a thing?!

00:21:25.590 --> 00:21:27.830
You're such a pervert, Mihari-chan!

00:21:28.960 --> 00:21:29.840
Honestly!

00:21:29.840 --> 00:21:32.970
It's because you were complaining
about it being uncomfortable!

00:21:32.970 --> 00:21:34.800
No, it's just...

00:21:37.800 --> 00:21:42.310
Anyway, I never knew you were
going through this every month.

00:21:42.310 --> 00:21:44.860
And all without whining about it once.

00:21:44.860 --> 00:21:46.130
What a trooper.

00:21:48.680 --> 00:21:49.670
Well!

00:21:49.670 --> 00:21:53.800
Next time your tummy's hurting,
let your big brother know, okay?

00:21:53.800 --> 00:21:56.700
I'll be there for you in a heart... beat...

00:21:56.700 --> 00:21:57.690
Eek!

00:21:57.690 --> 00:22:00.000
Wh-Wh-What did I do this time?!

00:22:00.000 --> 00:22:02.140
Have some tact!

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.970
Next Episode: Mahiro's Close Encounter

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.970
Illustration: Mai Yoneyama

00:23:38.170 --> 00:23:39.630
See you next time!
